[4] Parked Vehicle Fleet Management & AI Purge (Updated in v4.1.3)

    Low-Poly Migration (Performance Boost): Forced low_poly_only: true across all individual AI fallback profiles in Section 9 (ai.1951.oldsmobile through ai.xc90) to reduce rendering overhead in crowded yards.

    Tesla Purge: Completely removed traffic.tesla from all sport car lists, fallback profiles, and car dealer lots to resolve missing data chain physics errors.

    Car Dealer Reassignment: Replaced traffic.tesla with traffic.mustang in car_dealer.always.parked.physics.

    UDS Delivery Van Purge: Purged traffic.pv_uds across all package van, car ship, and general van spawn lists to streamline console logging.

