Parking Group D: Time-of-Day Traffic Weighting Schedules (v4.1.3 Rebalance)

    Municipal Sweepers (city.sweeper): Rebalanced to 0.6 Night / 0.3 Day to mirror realistic municipal maintenance hours.

    Standard Passenger Cars & Police: Daytime probability boosted from 1.0 to 1.5.

    Trucks & Trailer Combos: Daytime probability increased from 0.5 to 0.85; nighttime bumped to 0.55.

    SUVs & Pickups: Daytime baseline weighted to 3.7; nighttime baseline weighted to 1.2.

    Logistics & Service Fleets: Daytime DHL vans boosted to 1.2; Garbage trucks boosted to 0.6; Nighttime Limousines doubled to 0.2.
